5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the floor. We need to know what the building can actually hold.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Structural integrity is non-negotiable. I will look into the suspended bay.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,But who is doing the work? The staff list is old. I need to check the roster.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I keep hearing about late deliveries. I want to see the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,And where does the money go? I will check the loan transport costs over three seasons.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, if the bay fails, everything stops. Please confirm that is your priority.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,It is. A collapse is worse than a delay. I will verify the survey.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, costs are important, but if no one is there to open the doors, it fails.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the art isn't here, the doors don't matter. I need to see the delays.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, if the art is here but we are bankrupt, the doors close anyway.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the maintenance log for powered displays. They stress the floor.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the weekend head counts across ten seasons. Data over opinion.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the composition of the volunteer roster. They are the ones standing in the room.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will also look at the five years of visitor comment slips. They tell the truth.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also check the mount-making charges and joiner's rate. Hidden costs are everywhere.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am done for now. I need to think about what I found.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will wait for the data. Silence is often the best answer.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I am excited to see who is actually working. Let's find out.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope the comments are kind. But I need to know the truth.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I hope the invoices are honest. We will see.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
