35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The bay is capped at four hundred kilos. We cannot promise heavy stone without shoring.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The data confirms it. Head counts rise only where things move or change.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The volunteers are mostly history circle members. They know the old quarter, not the new tech.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The paperwork shows two late arrivals last year. The comments say people came back because someone was there.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The transport costs are a third of the budget. And the joiner's rate is up. We need to be careful.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, if we choose a heavy exhibit, we need to budget for shoring. It is not optional.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, I see. The numbers do not lie. We must plan for the weight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, if the volunteers are history people, can they run the new displays? I am worried.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, the comments say they want to talk to someone. We need to train them or hire help.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, shoring is expensive. If we choose a heavy exhibit, the budget will be tight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried. The floor is the limit. We have to respect it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"I am calculating the risk. The head counts suggest we need movement, not just weight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I am thinking about the people. If the volunteers are not ready, the room will feel empty.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I am thinking about the delays. If the art is late, the room is empty anyway.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I am thinking about the money. If the transport is expensive, the room is empty of funds.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
